{"id":"bc5b8d55ec7833aa","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-fo-query-pullback.md","title":"一阶解释的句子回译","display":"thm-fo-query-pullback — 一阶解释的句子回译","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-fo-query-pullback","aliases":["29-thm-fo-query-pullback"],"display":"thm-fo-query-pullback — 一阶解释的句子回译","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-query]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 3.3; Proposition 3.5, pp.47–48, DjVu scans 62–63","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-fo-query-pullback"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-fo-query-pullback</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fo-query-pullback — 一阶解释的句子回译"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 3.3; Proposition 3.5, pp.47–48, DjVu scans 62–63"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\">\\(I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>；输入和输出词汇为有限关系词汇。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>句子和满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a> 的有限非空输入模型类。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\exists\\widehat\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(A\\models\\widehat\\theta\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\models\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\exists\\widehat\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(A\\models\\widehat\\theta\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\models\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 3.5，印刷页 48，扫描页 63，及 Definition 3.3，印刷页 47，扫描页 62。已核对回译规则与语义式：每个域变量换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元组，输入关系换成定义公式，量词限制到输出域，常量用其唯一见证公式绑定。对公式结构归纳得到等价；这里不把回译存在性写成一个未定义的全局编译函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on"